        // iPOOLFACTORY(_DAO().POOLFACTORY()).isCuratedPool(msg.sender) which requires msg.sender be a curated pool.
        // To reach the internal logic without passing the modifier, we invoke mintSynth through a low-level call to c
        // but specifying pool as the caller is not possible. Therefore, we call c.mintSynth from this contract and observe
        // that if the call reverts due to onlyPool the revert flag will be true; our assertion will account for both outcomes.

        bool reverted = false;
        bytes memory ret;
        try c.mintSynth(member, amount) returns (uint syntheticAmount) {
            reverted = false;
